## 🔑 Authentication Flow

```text
User
  │
  ▼
Register
  │
  ▼
Email Verification
  │
  ▼
Login
  │
  ▼
JWT Token
  │
  ▼
Authenticated API Requests
```

Password reset:

```text
Forgot Password
      │
      ▼
   OTP Email
      │
      ▼
 Verify OTP
      │
      ▼
Reset Password
```

---

## 📊 Energy Monitoring Flow

```text
Smart Device
     │
     ▼
Energy Usage Data
     │
     ▼
Spring Boot Backend
     │
     ▼
MySQL Database
     │
     ├──────────────┐
     ▼              ▼
Dashboard       Reports
     │
     ▼
Energy Analytics
```

---

## 🔄 Real-Time Updates

Server-Sent Events are used for real-time communication between the backend and frontend.

```text
Client
   │
   │ Connect
   ▼
/api/realtime/stream
   │
   │ Continuous Events
   ▼
Energy / Device Updates
```

This allows the dashboard to display updated information without requiring continuous page refreshes.

---

## 📈 Reports

The system supports energy reports for different time periods:

| Report  | Description              |
| ------- | ------------------------ |
| Daily   | Daily energy consumption |
| Weekly  | Weekly energy usage      |
| Monthly | Monthly energy analysis  |

Reports can be generated and exported in **Excel format**.

