## 🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

1. Monitor household energy consumption.
2. Manage smart home devices efficiently.
3. Organize devices based on rooms.
4. Provide real-time energy information.
5. Identify high energy consumption.
6. Generate useful energy reports.
7. Notify users about unusual or peak usage.
8. Help users make better energy-management decisions.

